OL,3,GNEWSACouncil seeks new officer to boost
OL,4,AGlasgow's nightlife
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlasgow City Council is advertising for
OL,7,Fa new role aimed at boosting the city's
OL,8,Fnightlife.
OL,10,FThe senior officer for night-time
OL,11,Feconomy will be tasked with supporting
OL,12,Fclubs, pubs, restaurants and live music
OL,13,Fvenues at a time when the industry is
OL,14,Ffacing a number of challenges.
OL,16,FWhoever gets the job will be expected
OL,17,Fto work with the newly established
OL,18,Fnight-time economy commission and look
OL,19,Fat improving public safety, transport
OL,20,Fconnectivity and the overall experience
OL,21,Fat night for people in the city.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
